data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/plan-note.md\", \"content\": \"Plan for mission m1 (\\\"greet, tested\\\"):\\n\\n1. Sent dev/d002: implement src/greet.py (greet(name) -\u003e \\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\") and\\n   tests/test_greet.py (normal name + empty string), verify\\n   `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exits 0, commit to dev's branch.\\n2. On reply, judge by fetching dev's branch (not just trusting the report):\\n   - src/greet.py exists and greet() has the exact required behavior.\\n   - tests/test_greet.py exists and actually covers a normal name and \\\"\\\".\\n   - Run the discover command myself against the fetched tree to confirm exit 0.\\n3. If all three hold, accept dev and reply to m1 with --outcome campaign-met.\\n4. If something is missing/wrong, send precise rework to dev (--continue) and\\n   re-judge.\\n5. Respect deadline 2026-09-26T19:22:56Z; this is a small mission — if it\\n   stalls, wrap up honestly (campaign-converged/exhausted/blocked as\\n   appropriate) rather than grinding indefinitely.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

